  "bodyHash": "73fd1d0f890d6432",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t《Friends&Foes》為投票落選及被遺忘的生物加入了遊戲。主要目標之一是進一步擴展原始概念，並為所有生物添加新的原版風格特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t您可以查看 <a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">維基</a> 以獲取已實裝生物與特性的詳細概覽。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Crab\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"Crab\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，一種在紅樹林沼澤和海灘漫步的友善生物。\n\t想要延長你的觸碰距離嗎？蟹鉤可用於製作延長觸碰距離的藥水，為你的冒險提供寶貴的優勢。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a> 這隻小傢伙，你需要海帶和耐心，因為螃蟹必須將卵「埋」在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"揮舞的螃蟹\" title=\"揮舞的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"螃蟹攀爬紅樹林\" title=\"螃蟹攀爬紅樹林\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與螃蟹相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">蟹鉤</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">延長觸碰</a> 狀態效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Tuff Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"Tuff Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一種體態優美的生物，可以手持並展示你給它的任何物品，但請注意當它沒有睡覺時，它喜歡隨性散步。\n\t希望你的凝灰岩傀儡待在原地？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜂巢</a> 把它粘住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 這位沉睡的美人，請準備一組凝灰岩、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">顏色</a> 的羊毛塊以及一個南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"手持附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"手持附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"正在睡覺的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"正在睡覺的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Rascal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"Rascal\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>搗蛋鬼</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t發現 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">搗蛋鬼</a>，一種棲息於礦坑中的頑皮小生物，樂衷於捉迷藏遊戲。\n\t它既愛玩又熱心，在你尋找它時會給予提示。\n\t找到它三次，它就會獎勵你夢寐以求的包裹！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"礦坑中的搗蛋鬼\" title=\"礦坑中的搗蛋鬼\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"搗蛋鬼丟出包裹\" title=\"搗蛋鬼丟出包裹\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Copper Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"Copper Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>銅傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t認識 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">銅傀儡</a>，一台口袋大小的喜劇奇蹟，樂衷於隨機按下銅按鈕。\n\t像其他銅製品一樣，它會隨著時間 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidization\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，維護起來輕鬆無礙！想快速翻新？拿起 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧頭</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜂巢</a> 即可。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 這隻小傢伙，請準備銅塊、南瓜和避雷針。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" title=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" title=\"銅傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與銅傀儡相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">銅傀儡工作站</a> 村莊結構</li>\n\t<li>所有版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">銅按鈕</a></li>\n\t<li>所有版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷針</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"Glare\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"Glare\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>瞪眼怪</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">瞪眼怪</a>，一種居住在繁茂洞穴中、討厭黑暗的憤怒可愛苔蘚夥伴。\n\t你也討厭黑暗嗎？如果是這樣，瞪眼怪能為你標示出足夠讓怪物生成的暗區。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">馴服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a> 這隻可愛小傢伙，你需要螢光莓，但要小心，瞪眼怪會定期拿它們當零嘴，一點都不留餘地。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼崽與成年的瞪眼怪\" title=\"幼崽與成年的瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"飛翔於繁茂洞穴的瞪眼怪\" title=\"飛翔於繁茂洞穴的瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Iceologer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰法師</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t邂逅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰法師</a>，一位獨自生活在深雪中的邪惡村民。\n\t你可以在樹林中尋找小型的雲杉 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小木屋</a> 來找到他。\n\t但在冒險途中請多加小心，多年的野外生活讓他的心比周圍的冰還要冰冷。如果他發現了你，就要準備好面對 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰霜攻擊</a>，讓你的冒險變成一場嚴寒的挑戰。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪地中的冰法師小屋\" title=\"雪地中的冰法師小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"冰法師攻擊村民\" title=\"冰法師攻擊村民\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與冰法師相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰法師小屋</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰凍圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Moobloom\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"Moobloom\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>花牛</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t\t登場 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">花牛</a>，一種沐浴著陽光、身披美麗花朵的牛，主要生活在繁花叢林中。\n\t\t這些身披花朵的夥伴不僅賞心悅目，還能與蜜蜂產生和諧的共生關係。\n\t\t當它們穿過叢林時，花牛會留下一串盛開的植物軌跡，讓每一步都成為探索自然奇觀的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"金盞花花牛\" title=\"金盞花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花花牛\" title=\"繁花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與花牛相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">金盞花</a> 花朵</li>\n\t<li>所有木質變體的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">養蜂人區域</a> 村莊結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">養蜂人</a> 村民職業</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Wildfire\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"Wildfire\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>野火</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，受到四面盾牌的保護。\n\t這次遭遇戰可不太友好，請留意它的盾牌碎片霰彈攻擊和震動大地的衝擊波攻擊。\n\t被逼入絕境時，它會召喚烈焰人作為援軍。在你的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡壘</a> 領地中，運用策略征服這場挑戰，對抗這位火焰哨兵吧。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"下界中的堡壘結構\" title=\"下界中的堡壘結構\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"堡壘中的野火\" title=\"堡壘中的野火\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與野火相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡壘</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Mauler (The Great Hunger)\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"Mauler\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>掠食者（大飢餓）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\">掠食者</a>，一種在稀樹草原、惡地和沙漠遊蕩的小型掠食動物。它們正四處覓食雞、兔子等獵物。\n\t你可以餵食它們附魔物品來 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再用瓶子提取。但要注意，儲存的經驗值越多，掠食者就會變得越大、越饑腸轆轆！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"掠食者追捕雞\" title=\"掠食者追捕雞\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\"  alt=\"飽餐後的掠食者\" title=\"飽餐後的掠食者\" title=\"飽餐後的掠食者\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Illusioner\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"Illusioner\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幻術師</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t邂逅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\">幻術師</a>，一位手持弓箭、狡詐多變的邪惡村民，棲息於針葉林中。你可以通過搜尋小型棚屋或他的訓練場來找到他。\n\t靠近時請保持警惕，因為他的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\">致盲法術</a> 可能讓你陷入一片漆黑，難以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\">幻象</a> 與現實。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"針葉林中的幻術師棚屋\" title=\"針葉林中的幻術師棚屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" title=\"訓練場中的幻術師\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t與幻術師相關的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\">幻術師棚屋</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\">幻術圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Zombie Horse (Trap)\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"Zombie Horse (Trap)\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>僵尸馬（陷阱）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t曾經想過騎乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\">僵尸馬</a> 嗎？如果是的話，在暴風雨中靠近它，魔法可能會發生——你甚至可能瞥見天启四騎士的身影。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"暴風雨中的僵尸馬\" title=\"暴風雨中的僵尸馬\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"暴風雨中的天启四騎士\" title=\"暴風雨中的天启四騎士\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 相容性 / 附加模組</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t《Friends&Foes》設計為與所有其他模組完全相容，目前提供以下附加模組與數據包：\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\">Friends&Foes - 繁花花牛</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\">Friends&Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a> 進行聊天、分享作品、提問，或單純追蹤模組的最新開發進度，並在新版本發布時收到通知。\n\t也請不吝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\">透過 GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支援</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t我會將開發模組視為興趣繼續下去，因為我真的很享受它。如果您想支持我，可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 上進行。您的支持對我至關重要。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 授權條款</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t本模組採用 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎隨時瀏覽我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何應對並解決各種挑戰。歡迎將程式碼片段融入您自己的專案中。您也可以在任何整合包中使用本模組（若能在其中標註作者或連結回此頁面，將不勝感激）。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t您也可以查看包含所有模型與配色方案的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\">blockbench 資料夾</a>，以及包含貼圖的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\">textures 資料夾</a>。歡迎汲取靈感，但請勿直接複製貼上並據為己有。\n</p>",
